		{"id":"150fdb90c8174980","type":"text","text":"Priorities \nTier 1 \nTier 2 \nTier 3 \n\n**Investor A**\n\n- Invests Seed/Series A ✅\n- AI/Data focus ✅\n- Typical cheque matches Kruise ✅\n- Recently invested in similar companies ✅\n- Partner has relevant portfolio experience ✅\n\n→ **Tier 1**\n\n**Investor B**\n\n- Invests Seed ✅\n- SaaS ✅\n- Cheque fits ✅\n- But hasn't invested recently in your space\n\n→ **Tier 2**\n\n**Investor C**\n\n- Invests later-stage companies\n- Typical cheque much larger than Kruise's requirement\n\n→ **Tier 3 / potentially exclude**","x":660,"y":-52,"width":420,"height":752},
		{"id":"7b3464550ebdee63","type":"text","text":"Find contact apollo or Hunter","x":220,"y":240,"width":223,"height":95},
